                                                "sense_id": "98baec0c-4e16-33df-83a9-c6db81811649",
                                                "text": "About noon they came to a douar of about twenty tents. Here they halted, and as one of the Arabs was releasing the alfa-grass ropes which bound him to his mount they were surrounded by a mob of men, women, and children."
                                            }
